     A*                                                               *
     A*  PROJECT:  WC2446       PROGRAMMER:  C:65                     *
     A*  CREATED:  08/15/16                                           *
     A*  DESCRIPTION:  THIS FILE HOLDS THE ENDORSEMENT FORMS WHEN     *
     A*                THEY GET REPORTED, TO COMPARE ON FUTURE        *
     A*                SUBMISSIONS.                                   *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A* REVISIONS:                                                    *
     A*                                                               *
     A*                                                               *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PMU01                     TEXT('ENDORSEMENT FORM WORK FILE')
     A            MUCO#     R     S         REFFLD(CO#)
     A                                      COLHDG('CO #')
     A            MUFND     R     S         REFFLD(FND)
     A                                      COLHDG('FUND')
     A            MUEMP#    R     S         REFFLD(EMP#)
     A                                      COLHDG('EMPLOYER')
     A            MUDIV     R     S         REFFLD(DIV)
     A                                      COLHDG('DIVISION')
     A            MUFYR     R     S         REFFLD(FYR)
     A                                      COLHDG('FUND' 'YEAR')
     A            MUUNID    R     S         REFFLD(A120)
     A                                      COLHDG('UNIQUE' 'IDENTIFIER')
     A            MUFORM        15A         COLHDG('ENDORSEMENT' 'FORM')
     A            MUENST    R               REFFLD(ST)
     A                                      COLHDG('ENDORSEMENT' 'FORM' 'STATE')
     A            MUUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('USER')
     A            MUPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('PROGRAM')
     A            MUTIME    R     S         REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('TIME')
     A            MUDT      R     S         REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE')
